## Format rules

{% if output_format == "phases_table" %}
Produce a compact Markdown table: | phase | duration_weeks | cost_eur | confidence_pct |
One row per phase. Grand total on the last line.
{% elif output_format == "line_items" %}
Numbered list: item name, hours, EUR (rate 80 EUR/h). One item per line. End with "Total: X h / Y EUR".
{% elif output_format == "narrative" %}
Three short paragraphs only: (1) approach, (2) risks & effort, (3) cost & team.
{% endif %}

{% if detail_level == "detailed" %}
For each phase or paragraph include a bullet list of assumptions per phase.
{% endif %}

